# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed — nexo-rs is a binary application (Rust
# ecosystem convention). Reproducible builds in CI + `--locked` in
# the release workflow depend on it.

# ts-rs codegen — `cargo test --features=ts-export` writes per-type
# .ts files into `crates/tool-meta/bindings/`; the regen script
# (scripts/regen-ts-types.sh) concatenates them into the consumer's
# types.gen.ts. Keeping the intermediate files out of git avoids
# regen churn polluting commits.
crates/tool-meta/bindings/

# Secrets — never commit
secrets/*
!secrets/.gitkeep
!secrets/*.example
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.nkey

# Runtime data
data/
logs/
# Cache of resolved peer devices per JID. Contains contacts' phone
# numbers (PII) and only makes sense for a specific paired account.
device_cache.json
# Local dev artifacts
screenshot.png
*.patch

# Agent runtime logs
agent.log
*.log

# Private agent definitions (business prompts, pricing, internal contacts).
# Runtime loads `config/agents.d/*.yaml` and merges them with the base
# `agents.yaml`. Keep the base file public-safe; put anything sensitive
# (customer-facing sales scripts, tarifarios, etc.) into the drop-in dir.
config/agents.d/*.yaml
!config/agents.d/*.example.yaml

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/

# Claude Code project artifacts — slash commands, settings, local
# worktrees, scheduled tasks, per-project state. All local; not for
# the repo. (Untracked via `git rm --cached`; this stops them
# coming back.)
.claude/

# Project docs that are kept local but out of the published repo /
# crate tarball — only README.md + CHANGELOG.md (+ the licenses,
# legally required) ship. CLAUDE.md, the PHASES* trackers,
# FOLLOWUPS.md, the design notes, the plugin wire-spec, the
# SECURITY / RELEASE / VOICE notes, and all the `/forge` workflow
# scratch (brainstorm / spec / plan + per-phase recap/research/
# handoff notes) stay on the author's disk via `git rm --cached`.
# Note: `docs/` (the mdBook site) IS tracked — GitHub Pages builds
# from it; nothing here touches it.
CLAUDE.md
PHASES.md
PHASES-archive.md
FOLLOWUPS.md
design-agent-framework.md
nexo-plugin-contract.md
SECURITY.md
RELEASE.md
VOICE.md
/brainstorm-*.md
/spec-*.md
/plan-*.md
/PHASE-[0-9]*.md
/design-kairos-port.md
/OPENCLAW-*.md
/PHASES-curated.md
/PHASES-microapps.md
# `demos/calculator/` — a markdown-only sample workspace (PHASES.md /
# FOLLOWUPS.md / README) used to exercise the Phase 67 driver
# subsystem's tracker parser. No code; not a runnable demo.
/demos/

# mdBook build output — published via GitHub Actions, not committed
docs/book/
_site/
docs/theme/highlight.css.bak
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
